Ks 0.2 0.2 0.2
Ns 64
map_Kd checker.png
map_Bump flat_normal.png

newmtl StripeMat
Kd 1.0 1.0 1.0
Ks 0.6 0.6 0.6
Ns 200
map_Kd stripes.png

newmtl PlainRed
